&lt;td style="vertical-align:middle;border-top-style:solid;border-top-width:0.75pt;border-top-color:#000000;border-left-style:solid;border-left-width:0.75pt;border-left-color:#000000;border-right-style:solid;border-right-width:0.75pt;border-right-color:#000000;overflow:hidden;" valign="middle"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:center;padding-left:0pt;padding-right:0pt;line-height:12pt;font-size:10.5pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:9pt;"&gt;&lt;b&gt;●&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:center;padding-left:0pt;padding-right:0pt;line-height:12pt;font-size:12pt;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align:top;border-top-style:solid;border-top-width:0.75pt;border-top-color:#000000;border-left-style:solid;border-left-width:0.75pt;border-left-color:#000000;border-right-style:solid;border-right-width:0.75pt;border-right-color:#000000;overflow:hidden;" valign="top"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:9.4pt;padding-right:5.4pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-7.5pt;line-height:10pt;font-size:10.5pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:7.5pt;"&gt;・資源の枯渇等による原材料の調達困難化&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;padding-left:9.4pt;padding-right:5.4pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-7.5pt;line-height:10pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:7.5pt;"&gt;・水不足による施工への悪影響&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
