&lt;td style="vertical-align:bottom;border-top-style:solid;border-top-width:1.5pt;border-top-color:#000000;border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-width:0.75pt;border-bottom-color:#000000;border-left-style:solid;border-left-width:1.5pt;border-left-color:#000000;border-right-style:solid;border-right-width:0.75pt;border-right-color:#000000;background-color:#d8d8d8;overflow:hidden;" valign="bottom"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:center;padding-left:0.9pt;padding-right:1.4pt;margin-bottom:1.5pt;line-height:9pt;font-size:10.5pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:9pt;"&gt;&lt;b&gt;脱炭素社会&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align:bottom;border-top-style:solid;border-top-width:1.5pt;border-top-color:#000000;border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-width:0.75pt;border-bottom-color:#000000;border-left-style:solid;border-left-width:0.75pt;border-left-color:#000000;border-right-style:solid;border-right-width:0.75pt;border-right-color:#000000;background-color:#d8d8d8;overflow:hidden;" valign="bottom"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:center;padding-left:0.9pt;padding-right:1.4pt;margin-bottom:1.5pt;line-height:9pt;font-size:10.5pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:9pt;"&gt;&lt;b&gt;循環型社会&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align:bottom;border-top-style:solid;border-top-width:1.5pt;border-top-color:#000000;border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-width:0.75pt;border-bottom-color:#000000;border-left-style:solid;border-left-width:0.75pt;border-left-color:#000000;border-right-style:solid;border-right-width:0.75pt;border-right-color:#000000;background-color:#d8d8d8;overflow:hidden;" valign="bottom"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:center;padding-left:0.9pt;padding-right:1.4pt;margin-bottom:1.5pt;line-height:9pt;font-size:10.5pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:9pt;"&gt;&lt;b&gt;自然共生社会&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align:bottom;border-top-style:solid;border-top-width:1.5pt;border-top-color:#000000;border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-width:0.75pt;border-bottom-color:#000000;border-left-style:solid;border-left-width:0.75pt;border-left-color:#000000;border-right-style:solid;border-right-width:0.75pt;border-right-color:#000000;background-color:#d8d8d8;overflow:hidden;" valign="bottom"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:center;padding-left:1.4pt;padding-right:1.4pt;margin-bottom:1.5pt;line-height:15pt;font-size:10.5pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:9pt;"&gt;&lt;b&gt;2030年の想定&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align:bottom;border-top-style:solid;border-top-width:1.5pt;border-top-color:#000000;border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-width:0.75pt;border-bottom-color:#000000;border-left-style:solid;border-left-width:0.75pt;border-left-color:#000000;border-right-style:solid;border-right-width:0.75pt;border-right-color:#000000;background-color:#d8d8d8;overflow:hidden;" valign="bottom"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:center;padding-left:1.4pt;padding-right:1.4pt;margin-bottom:1.5pt;line-height:15pt;font-size:10.5pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:9pt;"&gt;&lt;b&gt;リスク・機会&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align:bottom;border-top-style:solid;border-top-width:1.5pt;border-top-color:#000000;border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-width:0.75pt;border-bottom-color:#000000;border-left-style:solid;border-left-width:0.75pt;border-left-color:#000000;border-right-style:solid;border-right-width:0.75pt;border-right-color:#000000;background-color:#d8d8d8;overflow:hidden;" valign="bottom"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:center;padding-left:1.4pt;padding-right:1.4pt;margin-bottom:1.5pt;line-height:10pt;font-size:10.5pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:9pt;"&gt;&lt;b&gt;影響度&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align:bottom;border-top-style:solid;border-top-width:1.5pt;border-top-color:#000000;border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-width:0.75pt;border-bottom-color:#000000;border-left-style:solid;border-left-width:0.75pt;border-left-color:#000000;border-right-style:solid;border-right-width:1.5pt;border-right-color:#000000;background-color:#d8d8d8;overflow:hidden;" valign="bottom"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:center;padding-left:1.4pt;padding-right:1.4pt;margin-bottom:1.5pt;line-height:15pt;font-size:10.5pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:9pt;"&gt;&lt;b&gt;対応策&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr style="height:122.3pt;min-height:122.3pt;"&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align:middle;border-top-style:solid;border-top-width:0.75pt;border-top-color:#000000;border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-width:0.75pt;border-bottom-color:#000000;border-left-style:solid;border-left-width:1.5pt;border-left-color:#000000;border-right-style:solid;border-right-width:0.75pt;border-right-color:#000000;overflow:hidden;" valign="middle"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:center;padding-left:0pt;padding-right:0pt;line-height:12pt;font-size:10.5pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:9pt;"&gt;&lt;b&gt;●&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align:middle;border-top-style:solid;border-top-width:0.75pt;border-top-color:#000000;border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-width:0.75pt;border-bottom-color:#000000;border-left-style:solid;border-left-width:0.75pt;border-left-color:#000000;border-right-style:solid;border-right-width:0.75pt;border-right-color:#000000;overflow:hidden;" valign="middle"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:center;padding-left:0pt;padding-right:0pt;line-height:12pt;font-size:10.5pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:9pt;"&gt;&lt;b&gt;●&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align:middle;border-top-style:solid;border-top-width:0.75pt;border-top-color:#000000;border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-width:0.75pt;border-bottom-color:#000000;border-left-style:solid;border-left-width:0.75pt;border-left-color:#000000;border-right-style:solid;border-right-width:0.75pt;border-right-color:#000000;overflow:hidden;" valign="middle"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:center;padding-left:0pt;padding-right:0pt;line-height:12pt;font-size:10.5pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:9pt;"&gt;&lt;b&gt;●&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align:top;border-top-style:solid;border-top-width:0.75pt;border-top-color:#000000;border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-width:0.75pt;border-bottom-color:#000000;border-left-style:solid;border-left-width:0.75pt;border-left-color:#000000;border-right-style:solid;border-right-width:0.75pt;border-right-color:#000000;overflow:hidden;" valign="top"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:9.3pt;padding-right:5.4pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-7.5pt;line-height:10pt;font-size:10.5pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:7.5pt;"&gt;・木造建物の基準が整備され高層木造建築が普及&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:9.3pt;padding-right:5.4pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-7.5pt;line-height:10pt;font-size:10.5pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:7.5pt;"&gt;・木材輸出国での森林資源の減少、国産木材市場の拡大&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:left;padding-left:9.3pt;padding-right:5.4pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-7.5pt;line-height:10pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:7.5pt;"&gt;・資源循環・自然共生が不動産価値の構成要素化&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align:top;border-top-style:solid;border-top-width:0.75pt;border-top-color:#000000;border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-width:0.75pt;border-bottom-color:#000000;border-left-style:solid;border-left-width:0.75pt;border-left-color:#000000;border-right-style:solid;border-right-width:0.75pt;border-right-color:#000000;overflow:hidden;" valign="top"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:9.3pt;padding-right:5.4pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-8.9pt;line-height:10pt;font-size:10.5pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:7.5pt;"&gt;&lt;b&gt;（リスク）&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:9.3pt;padding-right:5.4pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-7.5pt;line-height:10pt;font-size:10.5pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:7.5pt;"&gt;・対応の遅れによる受注機会の喪失&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:9.3pt;padding-right:5.4pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-7.5pt;line-height:10pt;font-size:10.5pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:7.5pt;"&gt;・木造・木質関連技術開発の遅れ、人財不足による受注機会喪失&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:9.3pt;padding-right:5.4pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-7.5pt;line-height:10pt;font-size:10.5pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:7.5pt;"&gt;・認証木材の需要増加による調達ルート確保困難化、コスト増&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:9.3pt;padding-right:5.4pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-8.9pt;line-height:10pt;font-size:10.5pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:7.5pt;"&gt;&lt;b&gt;（機会）&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:9.3pt;padding-right:5.4pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-7.5pt;line-height:10pt;font-size:10.5pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:7.5pt;"&gt;・木造・木質建築の需要の増加&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:9.3pt;padding-right:5.4pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-7.5pt;line-height:10pt;font-size:10.5pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:7.5pt;"&gt;・不動産価値向上に資する資源循環・自然共生に配慮した設計・開発の需要増加&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align:middle;border-top-style:solid;border-top-width:0.75pt;border-top-color:#000000;border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-width:0.75pt;border-bottom-color:#000000;border-left-style:solid;border-left-width:0.75pt;border-left-color:#000000;border-right-style:solid;border-right-width:0.75pt;border-right-color:#000000;overflow:hidden;" valign="middle"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:center;padding-left:0pt;padding-right:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:0pt;line-height:10pt;font-size:10.5pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:7.5pt;"&gt;中&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align:top;border-top-style:solid;border-top-width:0.75pt;border-top-color:#000000;border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-width:0.75pt;border-bottom-color:#000000;border-left-style:solid;border-left-width:0.75pt;border-left-color:#000000;border-right-style:solid;border-right-width:1.5pt;border-right-color:#000000;overflow:hidden;" valign="top"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:9.3pt;padding-right:5.4pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-7.5pt;line-height:10pt;font-size:10.5pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:7.5pt;"&gt;・木造・木質関連技術の高度化、差別化、技術者確保の推進&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:9.3pt;padding-right:5.4pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-7.5pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:10pt;font-size:10.5pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:7.5pt;"&gt;・サーキュラーエコノミー・ネイチャーポジティブに配慮した木材調達ルートの確保による適切な木材調達の推進&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:9.3pt;padding-right:5.4pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-7.5pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:10pt;font-size:10.5pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:7.5pt;"&gt;・ＢＩＭ/ＣＩＭと連携したサーキュラープラットフォームの構築による、建設物のライフサイクルでの資源循環及び見える化の推進&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:9.3pt;padding-right:5.4pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-7.5pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:10pt;font-size:10.5pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:7.5pt;"&gt;・資源循環・自然共生に十分配慮した開発計画の推進&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
