  <jpcrp_cor:NotesRegardingAmountOfRevenueFromContractsWithCustomersTextBlock contextRef="CurrentYearDuration">&lt;p class="smt_head6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;padding-left:13.5pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;text-align:justify;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:14pt;"&gt;※１  顧客との契約から生じる収益&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text1" style="orphans:0;widows:0;padding-left:40.5pt;text-indent:9pt;"&gt;顧客との契約から生じる収益の金額は、「第５　経理の状況　１　連結財務諸表等　(1)連結財務諸表　（収益認識関係）　１　顧客との契約から生じる収益を分解した情報」に記載のとおりであります。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:27pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:14pt;font-size:14pt;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;</jpcrp_cor:NotesRegardingAmountOfRevenueFromContractsWithCustomersTextBlock>
  <jpcrp_cor:NotesRegardingLossOnConstructionContractsTextBlock contextRef="CurrentYearDuration">&lt;p class="smt_head6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;padding-left:13.5pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;text-align:justify;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:14pt;"&gt;※２  売上原価に含まれる工事損失引当金繰入額&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_unitR" style="orphans:0;widows:0;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
